00, "platform": 49, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 394608, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghc.jpg"}, {"id": 394609, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghd.jpg"}, {"id": 394607, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghb.jpg"}, {"id": 394614, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghi.jpg"}, {"id": 394610, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghe.jpg"}, {"id": 394606, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8gha.jpg"}, {"id": 394612, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghg.jpg"}, {"id": 394613, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghh.jpg"}, {"id": 394616, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghk.jpg"}, {"id": 394611, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghf.jpg"}, {"id": 394615, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8ghj.jpg"}], "slug": "marvels-avengers", "storyline": "Marvel\u2019s Avengers begins at A-Day, as San Francisco celebrates the opening of an Avengers West Coast Headquarters and an all-new helicarrier, powered by new experimental technology. The day turns tragic when a terrible accident results in mass destruction. Blamed for the tragedy, the Avengers disband.\n\nIron Man, Hulk, Black Widow, and Thor blame themselves for the mass devastation and the loss of Captain America. In the five years following A-Day, the team\u2019s absence has devastating consequences worldwide. A new organization has risen - Advanced Idea Mechanics, otherwise known as AIM. AIM believes that science \u2013 not Super Heroes \u2013 is the key to protecting the world.\n\nA teenager Kamala finds herself developing extraordinary polymorphic and healing powers as a direct result of exposure to Terrigen Mists during the A-day incident. With the Avengers disbanded and Advanced Idea Mechanics turning public sentiment against Super Heroes, Kamala hides her abilities from the world.\n\nKamala\u2019s unwavering loyalty to the Avengers, intelligence, inquisitive nature, and ever-optimistic personality lead to a huge discovery when she uncovers a shocking conspiracy. As Kamala learns to harness and embrace her powers, she finds the will and the way to reassemble Earth\u2019s Mightiest Heroes.", "summary": "Marvel\u2019s Avengers is an action-adventure game developed by Crystal Dynamics and published by Square Enix in 2020. It features both a single-player campaign and multiplayer missions, combining narrative-driven gameplay with cooperative online play. The story follows Kamala Khan as she reunites the Avengers after a catastrophic event. Players can control multiple heroes, each with unique abilities and skill trees.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/marvels-avengers", "videos": [{"id": 39012, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "bOAKfajsAiY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bOAKfajsAiY", "title": "Marvel's Avengers: Co-op War Zones Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bOAKfajsAiY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 39010, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "51g0W7RiKVM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=51g0W7RiKVM", "title": "Marvel's Avengers: Once An Avenger Gameplay Video", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/51g0W7RiKVM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 39011, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Sjbq_1umM3k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sjbq_1umM3k", "title": "Marvel's Avengers: The MODOK Threat Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Sjbq_1umM3k/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 39008, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5g2ct2MuvK8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5g2ct2MuvK8", "title": "Marvel's Avengers: Kamala Khan Embiggen Trailer  - NYCC 2019 [EN]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5g2ct2MuvK8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 39009, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "UzDq7QfwO1o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzDq7QfwO1o", "title": "Marvel's Avengers: Game Overview", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UzDq7QfwO1o/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 121380, "name": "A-Day Trailer", "video_id": "LDBojdBAjXU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LDBojdBAjXU", "title": "Marvel\u2019s Avengers: A-Day | Official Trailer E3 2019", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LDBojdBAjXU/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}